  "design": {
    "idea": "The Discarded Lantern-Jar: inside a sideways glass bottle while Hundred Lamps' giant shadow glides outside, align a dewdrop and two Blue Transformers so ONE 45-degree shot loops 5 times around the curved glass walls to frost-pin all 4 fruits simultaneously and pop the cork guarding the Boss Key.",
